<title>BELGIUM: Snow White, dwarfs face chop in Belgium.</title>
<headline>Snow White, dwarfs face chop in Belgium.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thousands of counterfeit Snow Whites and even larger numbers of her seven dwarfs face the chop after Belgian customs seized 13 container-loads full of them at the port of Antwerp, Belga news agency said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The plastic Walt Disney characters were on their way from China to France, Belga said citing a justice source.</p>
<p>As with hundreds of fake Smurfs also recently seized on their way through Belgium, the counterfeit Disney characters will be destroyed.</p>
</text>
